# Generation intermediates. Every pass leaves a 3 MB raw per clip plus closed/fixed/held variants,
# and masko/out is full of contact sheets and frame grids used to judge them. Only the finished
# clips are worth keeping; everything here can be regenerated from the prompts.
masko/clips/*_raw.mp4
masko/clips/*_closed.mp4
masko/clips/*_fixed.mp4
masko/clips/*_held.mp4
masko/clips/*_preview.mp4
masko/clips/idle_loop*
masko/clips/idle_to_yes*
masko/out/
masko/poses/
masko/strips/
masko/_mf/

# Earlier experiments in this folder, superseded by masko/
build/
costume/
poses/
strips/
out/

# Unreleased product UI. The screen mockup and the overlay drawn on it are app design, not mascot
